## Phase 2.1: Texture resources and uploads
Docs: [Resource System](../planning/subsystems/resource-system.md), [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md), [Command Model](../planning/subsystems/command-model.md)
- [ ] Implement texture creation with explicit initial access state.
- [ ] Implement texture SRV/UAV view descriptors and subresource ranges.
- [ ] Implement staging uploads for textures and mip generation policy.
- [ ] Implement sampler state creation and binding.
- [ ] Implement texture copy/blit commands for staging and mip workflows (shared copy/blit surface).

## Phase 2.2: Descriptor layouts for textures
Docs: [Descriptors and Binding](../planning/subsystems/descriptors-and-binding.md), [Shader System](../planning/subsystems/shader-system.md), [Driver Backends](../planning/subsystems/driver-backends.md)
- [ ] Define binding spaces for per-material and per-draw resources.
- [ ] Expand reflection to include resource bindings and stage visibility.
- [ ] Create binding layout objects with stable hashing and merge rules.
- [ ] Implement backend slot translation for layout slots and stage visibility.
- [ ] Implement descriptor allocation (per-frame rings + persistent pools).
- [ ] Implement descriptor table updates for textures and samplers.
- [ ] Enforce descriptor table lifetime rules (transient reset, persistent ownership).
- [ ] Validate bindings against reflection-driven layouts.

## Phase 2.3: Pipeline state caching
Docs: [Pipeline State](../planning/subsystems/pipeline-state.md), [Command Model](../planning/subsystems/command-model.md), [Driver Backends](../planning/subsystems/driver-backends.md)
- [ ] Implement PSO hashing and runtime cache lookup.
- [ ] Implement dynamic state commands (viewport, scissor, stencil ref, blend factors).
- [ ] Render a textured mesh end-to-end through the RHI.

## Phase 2.4: Shader-visible view descriptors
Docs: [Resource System](../planning/subsystems/resource-system.md), [Descriptors and Binding](../planning/subsystems/descriptors-and-binding.md)
- [ ] Implement buffer view descriptors for constant, SRV, and UAV usage.
- [ ] Validate view compatibility with resource formats and usage flags.

## Phase 2.5: Pooled allocators and transient aliasing
Docs: [Resource System](../planning/subsystems/resource-system.md), [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md)
- [ ] Implement pooled allocator backing for buffers and textures.
- [ ] Record transient aliasing metadata for compatible resources.
- [ ] Implement transient aliasing allocation and reuse for compatible resources.
- [ ] Enforce aliasing lifetime rules across submit boundaries and transitions.
